"Use facts to emit an immediate draft diagram and internally optimize it "
"with the LLM; use render to emit a diagram from an explicit "
"semantic_plan."
msgstr "使用 facts 立即发出草稿架构图，并由 LLM 在工具内部优化；使用 render 根据显式 semantic_plan 发出架构图。"

#: src/iac_code/pipeline/engine/show_diagram_tool.py
